And the thing that brought me into it more quickly than anything was a man who had a cancer in the stomach.

01:04:53.720 --> 01:04:59.720
This was a man who staggered into a table just on the brass end of gas.

01:04:59.720 --> 01:05:01.720
It was a bag of bones.

01:05:01.720 --> 01:05:03.720
That's the ray on the bed.

01:05:03.720 --> 01:05:08.720
Dr. Rife dealt with my cancer, said, just feel that man's stomach, doctor.

01:05:08.720 --> 01:05:13.720
So I put my hand on his stomach, which was a warm, solid, hard mass,

01:05:13.720 --> 01:05:15.720
about just what I could cover with my hand.

01:05:15.720 --> 01:05:18.720
And it was absolutely solid.

01:05:18.720 --> 01:05:22.720
And I thought, well, nothing can be done for that.

01:05:22.720 --> 01:05:27.720
However, they gave him a treatment of the Rife frequencies.

01:05:27.720 --> 01:05:34.720
And in the course of time, to my astonishment, he completely recovered.

01:05:42.720 --> 01:05:46.720
How many times and what was the extent of each treatment, Dr. Rife?

01:05:46.720 --> 01:05:49.720
Well, we used three minutes on each treatment.

01:05:49.720 --> 01:05:53.720
And we found the patients between it twice a week.

01:05:53.720 --> 01:05:58.720
We got better results than when we treated every day, simply because when we worked down,

01:05:58.720 --> 01:06:02.720
you know, revitalized this virus or organism in the tissues of the body,

01:06:02.720 --> 01:06:06.720
can't get the lymphatic system a chance to absorb it and take it up and cast it all.

01:06:06.720 --> 01:06:09.720
We treated half of them every day and half of them twice a week.

01:06:09.720 --> 01:06:12.720
And the last we treated twice a week, we got better results.

01:06:12.720 --> 01:06:19.720
