01:07:15.720 --> 01:07:18.720
Where independent verification of the work was concerned,

01:07:18.720 --> 01:07:22.720
it was only Dr. Burnett who continued with Rife in good faith.

01:07:22.720 --> 01:07:27.720
The other research organizations after a flurry of initial enthusiasm

01:07:27.720 --> 01:07:31.720
wasted years of time by embroiling Rife and Johnson

01:07:31.720 --> 01:07:35.720
